  "version": "0.6.0-alpha.3",
  "notes": "## 0.6.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-01\n\n### Features\n\n- Improve local-device discovery so pairing and transfers are more reliable when devices are on the same network.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent the add-device dialog from replacing the success state with a new invitation after pairing completes.\n- Removing a device now fully clears it so it no longer receives sync attempts and can be paired again cleanly.\n- New installs no longer show an incorrect re-pair prompt after the first setup is completed.\n- Avoid unusable virtual network addresses so device connections and transfers are less likely to fail on VPN or proxy setups.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.6.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-01\n\n### Features\n\n- 改进同一局域网内的设备发现，让配对和传输更可靠。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复添加设备时，配对完成后成功状态被新邀请覆盖的问题。\n- 移除设备后现在会完整清理该设备，避免继续尝试同步，并支持之后重新配对。\n- 全新安装完成首次设置后，不再错误显示重新配对提示。\n- 避开不可用的虚拟网络地址，降低 VPN 或代理环境下设备连接和传输失败的概率。",
